{"abstract":"Natural Language Processing (NLP) continues to advance. How- ever, native Ghanaian languages like many other languages in the world remain untouched. Limited availability of annotated data in these languages is, perhaps, the primary limiting factor. This work explores the development of a useful and practical NLP system for Twi, a native Ghanaian language, under the constraint of limited data. The result is a system developed using only 4.65 minutes of annotated speech data that allows searching for selected Twi songs by saying the song title in Twi.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Sasu, David","Asamoah Owusu, Dennis"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-695230"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Maryland"],"keyword":["Machine learning","Natural Language Processing"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a functional nlp system for twi akan using limited data","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-695230","ids":["itu-27a83492-4428-468a-9c05-bc328938a8d0"],"keyword":["Machine Learning","Natural Language Processing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B108C0AF31355DA8F63CA9D0C1EFEB56"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, NLPnorth"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"university of maryland","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Maryland","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"David","key":"sasupau","last":"Sasu","locid":"845595fe-6614-4cf2-968c-3e815db79b4d","name":"Sasu, David","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Dennis","key":"asamoahowusupau","last":"Asamoah Owusu","name":"Asamoah Owusu, Dennis","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["45039999"],"journal":"ACM SIGCAS Conference on Computing and Sustainable Societies","status":"p","title":"ACM SIGCAS Conference on Computing and Sustainable Societies"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-27a83492-4428-468a-9c05-bc328938a8d0"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Functional NLP System for Twi (Akan) Using Limited Data","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-695230","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
